Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.51,0:05:29.14,Sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.5\shad2\fs38\fad(650,850)\fnComixxx\c&HFFFDF9&\pos(337,136)\4c&H23211C&}Dear Santa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.57,0:00:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.41,0:00:18.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.78,0:00:22.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you gonna ask Santa for?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.08,0:00:28.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I still haven't decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.34,0:00:36.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't hurry, it'll be too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.01,0:00:37.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's coming from really far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:41.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.02,0:00:46.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, so what do you want the most?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.27,0:00:49.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Lop Ear...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.57,0:00:51.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.65,0:00:53.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,needs a friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.00,0:01:07.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.29,0:01:10.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry I'm so late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.92,0:01:12.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.46,0:01:14.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.18,0:01:20.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.85,0:01:23.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a Christmas tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.27,0:01:28.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.06,0:01:31.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just something from work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.07,0:01:41.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can we set up the tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.72,0:02:01.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry, Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.05,0:02:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.02,0:02:09.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This goes at the very top, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.85,0:02:10.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.91,0:02:24.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.45,0:02:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Our house doesn't have a chimney.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.63,0:02:34.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Santa will find a way in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.97,0:02:39.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's unlock the door for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.34,0:02:41.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.11,0:02:55.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's with the carrot?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.40,0:02:57.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's for Mr. Reindeer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.54,0:03:12.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm turning the lights off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.54,0:03:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.67,0:03:18.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Santa will only come once you're asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.51,0:03:20.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?! Then turn them off already!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.18,0:03:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.73,0:04:55.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to meet Santa too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.57,0:05:02.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's eat, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.23,0:05:03.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.54,0:05:17.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.50,0:05:20.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mr. Reindeer said thank you.
